    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d102">

                <pb facs="0220" n="104" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg104"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 793. 94/250.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-03-13T22:00:00+08:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 13, 1915—10 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Chinese Government is informed that the second Japanese squadron has sailed
                    with 30,000 men to be distributed in Manchuria, Tientsin, Shantung and
                    Hankow.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Reinsch.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
